{"unit_id":"nxz1026__dsh-tray#card-zh","repo":"nxz1026/dsh-tray","commit":"768679c375111f4b76536f7592d5ae522b5ae58a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tray 是 Windows 托盘启动器，可管理本机或 SSH 云端的 DSH Web 服务。用户可启动、停止和重启服务，打开 Web UI、查看日志，并设置登录时启动；远程模式会建立本地 SSH 隧道。适合希望从桌面托盘管理 DSH Web 的 Windows 用户。本地需配置启动命令，远程需配置 SSH 主机和密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.js:7","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:104","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:230","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:300"]}
{"unit_id":"nxz1026__dsh-tray#card-en","repo":"nxz1026/dsh-tray","commit":"768679c375111f4b76536f7592d5ae522b5ae58a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Tray is a Windows tray launcher for DSH Web. Use it to start, stop, or restart a local or SSH-hosted server, open the Web UI, follow logs, and launch at login. Remote mode creates a local SSH tunnel. Configure Windows, a local start command or remote SSH host and key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.js:7","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:104","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:230","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:300"]}
