{"unit_id":"nxz1026__dsh-tray#feature-1","repo":"nxz1026/dsh-tray","commit":"768679c375111f4b76536f7592d5ae522b5ae58a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tray 的功能「托盘控制服务」：从 Windows 托盘菜单启动、停止或重启 DSH Web，并显示服务运行状态。启动时可按配置自动拉起服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/dsh-tray.ps1:320","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:408"]}
{"unit_id":"nxz1026__dsh-tray#feature-2","repo":"nxz1026/dsh-tray","commit":"768679c375111f4b76536f7592d5ae522b5ae58a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tray 的功能「打开页面与查看日志」：从托盘菜单打开本地 Web UI，或在终端窗口中持续查看本机日志；远程模式通过 SSH 跟踪云端日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/dsh-tray.ps1:230","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:312"]}
{"unit_id":"nxz1026__dsh-tray#feature-3","repo":"nxz1026/dsh-tray","commit":"768679c375111f4b76536f7592d5ae522b5ae58a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tray 的功能「远程 SSH 模式」：选择 remote 模式后，通过 SSH 在云端启动 DSH Web 并建立到本地端口的隧道；托盘检测服务开始响应后再标记为运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/dsh-tray.ps1:125","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:145","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:84"]}
{"unit_id":"nxz1026__dsh-tray#feature-4","repo":"nxz1026/dsh-tray","commit":"768679c375111f4b76536f7592d5ae522b5ae58a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tray 的功能「登录时启动」：托盘菜单可为当前 Windows 用户添加或移除登录启动项，启动命令优先使用隐藏控制台的 VBS 启动器。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/dsh-tray.ps1:260","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:345"]}
{"unit_id":"nxz1026__dsh-tray#caveat-1","repo":"nxz1026/dsh-tray","commit":"768679c375111f4b76536f7592d5ae522b5ae58a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tray 使用前须知：该启动器限定 Windows；远程模式需要配置 SSH 主机和密钥，并通过 SSH 启动云端服务及建立本地端口隧道（见 assets/dsh-tray.ps1:125-157）。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/dsh-tray.ps1:125","assets/dsh-tray.ps1:145"]}
